    title: "UK: Police arrest Palestine Action supporters outside Supreme Court",
    summary: "Police arrested supporters of Palestine Action outside the Supreme Court in London, United Kingdom, on Wednesday 4 November, as a legal battle over the British government's ban on the group resumed.",
